employees to other companies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202250/extras/ebf3bfadd4246894f6a9a83489571a79.poster.avif?t=1753966299\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202250/extras/ebf3bfadd4246894f6a9a83489571a79.webm?t=1753966299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202250/extras/ebf3bfadd4246894f6a9a83489571a79.mp4?t=1753966299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your own game projects. Increase your followers. Rock the charts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202250/extras/d372ad808cbf7e47badcb62894537685.poster.avif?t=1753966299\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202250/extras/d372ad808cbf7e47badcb62894537685.webm?t=1753966299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202250/extras/d372ad808cbf7e47badcb62894537685.mp4?t=1753966299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Employee Tracking</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow those who try to escape from work with a camera and make them return to their work. Because you will have a specific schedule to finish the work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202250/extras/cf9978d3b9998b8089d72c1466e96dd0.poster.avif?t=1753966299\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https: